          "relevance": 5.297,
          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "To export the whole workspace, an Owner or Admin opens Settings, then Data, then Export workspace, and chooses JSON. The JSON export keeps project structure, task dependencies and history, so it is the format to use for a migration or a backup. Workspace export is available on the Team and Business plans."
        },
