          "lineage": "verbatim",
          "injection_risk": "untrusted_content",
          "body": "Fernway prepares the export in the background and emails a download link when it is ready, usually within an hour for large workspaces. The link is valid for 24 hours and can be used only by the person who requested the export."
        },
